# Deploy vajasklicsu.com after site changes

This site is live at https://vajasklicsu.com via GitHub Pages (`vajasdora/AI`, branch `main`).

After any change to the website (HTML, CSS, assets, deploy config):

1. Run the deploy script from the repo root:
   `powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File ../scripts/deploy-site.ps1`
2. Confirm `git push origin main` succeeded.
3. Tell the user the live site will update within 1–2 minutes (hard refresh if needed).

Do not leave site edits only on the local machine. Every website change must be pushed to `main`.

If deploy fails, diagnose and retry before finishing the task.
